==About==
===Format===
* '''Group Stage:''' ''July 2<sup>nd</sup> – July 7<sup>th</sup>, 2026''
** Four Double-Elimination format (GSL) Groups
*** Each group has four teams
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top two teams}} from each group advance to the '''Playoffs'''
*** <span class="mw-customtoggle-GroupStage-Draw" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''Click here for detailed information about Group Stage Draw''</span>
<div class="table-responsive">
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-GroupStage-Draw" style="margin-top:10px;" style="margin-left:45px;">
* 16 Teams are divided into 3 pools as per their seeding.
** '''Pool 1''' consists of teams that invited through Stage 1 with '''Pool 2''' and '''Pool 3''' consists of Title Defender and team that qualified through Online Qualifiers.
*** '''Pool 1''' consists of '''VCT Stage 1 winners''' - {{Team|Team Heretics}}, {{Team|G2 Esports}},{{Team|Edward Gaming}} & {{Team|Paper Rex}}.
*** '''Pool 2''' consists of '''Title Defender & OQ Upper Bracket winners''' - {{Team|Team Vitality}}, {{Team|MIBR}}, {{Team|100t}}, {{Team|xlg}}, {{Team|gentle mates}}, {{Team|karmine corp}}, {{Team|rrq}} & {{Team|global esports}}.
*** '''Pool 3''' consists of '''OQ Lower Bracket winners''' - {{Team|nrg}}, {{Team|all gamers}}, {{Team|bbl esports}} & {{Team|ns redforce}}.
** Due to {{Team|Team Heretics}} received the higher seed via [[VCT/2026/EMEA League/Stage 1|VCT EMEA Stage 1]], {{Team|Team Vitality}} inherits the Title Defender seed.
* Each group will feature one team from Pool 1, two teams from Pool 2 and one team from Pool 3.
* One team per region for each group.
** {{Team|Team Vitality}} is not considered to be part of any region as the Title Defender seed.

</div></div>
* '''Playoffs:''' ''July 9<sup>th</sup> – July 12<sup>th</sup>, 2026''
** Single-Elimination bracket
** All matches ''(excl. Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** The Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo5}}

